 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-ctec-live-scan-background-check\"><div id=\"tcf-ctec-live-scan-background-check-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>",
 "ssr": "<div data-screen-label=\"CTEC Live Scan Background Check\" class=\"tcf-screen\"><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/photos/ctec-org-desktop.webp\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"/><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#95AB3B\">For new preparers</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:900px\">CTEC Live Scan and <span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800\">Background Check</span></h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:660px;text-wrap:pretty\">Every new California tax preparer must pass a criminal background check and submit fingerprints through Live Scan before CTEC will approve their registration. Here is how the process works, step by step.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px\"><a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/#find-schools\" style=\"background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:8px\">Compare 60-hour courses</a><a data-hv=\"14\" href=\"#steps\" style=\"border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:13.5px 26px;border-radius:8px\">See the steps</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div><div id=\"steps\" style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#fff;scroll-margin-top:110px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\">\n<div style=\"max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">The process</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">How the CTEC <span style=\"font-weight:800\">background check works</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">You can study for the 60 hour CTEC course at the same time, but CTEC will not approve your registration until your background check is cleared.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">01</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Start the CTEC new preparer application</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Apply on CTEC\u2019s website and pay the <strong>$100 non-refundable application fee plus a $2 processing fee</strong>. Use your full Social Security number and your name exactly as it appears on your Social Security card.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">02</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Answer the background questionnaire</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Disclose any criminal history, even offenses that were dismissed, expunged or happened more than 10 years ago. Complete, honest answers keep your application moving.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">03</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Complete your Live Scan fingerprints</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Download the Live Scan form from your CTEC account and take it to a Live Scan location. The location sends your fingerprints electronically to the California Department of Justice (DOJ). Keep your copy of the form; do not mail it to CTEC.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">04</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Wait for CTEC\u2019s review</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">The DOJ sends your results to CTEC, and review typically takes <strong>2 to 8 weeks</strong>. CTEC may email you for more information; reply promptly, because an unanswered request can lead to a proposed denial.</p></div>\n</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB;align-items:start\">\n<div style=\"font:300 52px/1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#7E9330\">05</div>\n<div><h3 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Finish your registration</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652;max-width:760px;text-wrap:pretty\">Once CTEC emails your approval, log in, complete the registration and pay the registration fee. Make sure your <a href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">60 hour CTEC course</a>, IRS PTIN and $5,000 bond are in place. You then become a CTEC Registered Tax Preparer (CRTP).</p></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#95AB3B\">Key facts</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.12 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff\">The CTEC Live Scan at a glance</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);text-wrap:pretty\">Only new applicants go through the background check. Registered preparers renew each year with the 20 hour CTEC course instead.</p>\n<a href=\"/how-to-become-a-ctec-registered-tax-preparer/\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#95AB3B;margin-top:2px\">How to become a CTEC tax preparer \u2192</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:18px 24px;background:rgba(108,190,69,.18);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)\"><span style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff\">Who needs it</span><span style=\"font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif\">New applicants</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Application fee</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">$100 + $2</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">CTEC review after DOJ results</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">2\u20138 weeks</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Register after your 60 hour course</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">Within 18 months</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Fingerprint form</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">From your CTEC account</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Mail the form to CTEC?</span><span style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap\">No</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:80px 56px;background:#F4F6F7\">\n<div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n<div><div style=\"font:700 19px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330;margin-bottom:10px\">Questions</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 34px/1.12 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">Common questions</h2></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Do I need a Live Scan to renew my CTEC registration?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">No. CTEC requires the background check and fingerprinting (Live Scan) for new applicants. Registered preparers renew each year by completing the <a href=\"/ctec-20-hour-course/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">20 hour CTEC course</a>, keeping their PTIN and bond current and paying the renewal fee by October 31.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Can I take the 60 hour CTEC course before my Live Scan?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">Yes. You can complete the 60 hour qualifying education course before you apply, but you cannot become registered until you pass the background check. If you are unsure about your history, start the application and Live Scan early.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">What do I have to disclose on the background questionnaire?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">CTEC asks you to report criminal history in full, including offenses that were dismissed or expunged and ones that happened more than 10 years ago. Leaving something out is treated more seriously than the offense itself.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">How long does the CTEC background check take?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">After the California Department of Justice sends your results, CTEC\u2019s review typically takes 2 to 8 weeks. Answer any email from CTEC quickly; an unanswered request can lead to a proposed denial.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">Do I mail my Live Scan form to CTEC?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">No. The Live Scan location sends your fingerprints electronically to the Department of Justice. Keep your copy of the form for your records.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E9EB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 26px\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif\">How much does Live Scan cost?</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.62;color:#2F4652\">The CTEC application fee is $100 plus a $2 processing fee and is non-refundable. Live Scan locations set their own fingerprinting fees, so ask the location before your appointment.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:56px 56px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #E3E9EB\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:18px;color:#0B2E40\">\n<div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 34px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#0B2E40\">Studying while you wait?</h2><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:22px;color:#0B2E40\">Compare every CTEC-approved 60 hour course by price, format and current offers.</p></div>\n<a data-hv=\"4\" href=\"/ctec-60-hour-course/#find-schools\" style=\"flex:none;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:16px 30px;border-radius:8px\">Compare 60-hour courses</a>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"padding:0 56px 48px;background:#fff\"><p style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Rules summarized from the California Tax Education Council. Requirements and fees can change, so confirm with CTEC before you apply: <a href=\"https://ctec.org/media-room/how-to-become-a-tax-preparer-in-california/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">How to become a tax preparer in California (CTEC)</a>.</p></div></div>",
